{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"亲近重新回到心里写的是熟悉的内在感受，没有把珠子里的柔软意象写成具体往事或现实动作；不急着回答是合理的心理反应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"愿意多停一会儿表达的是对短暂安静的留恋，并非真的准备离开或回头看某个地方；未解决的争取难题也没有被写成外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-7 已说明他舍不得把心思从那份满足中抽回现实，足以解释为难时那份亲近为什么又回到心里。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-4 留下的怎样争取才不伤温柔的问题仍未解决，确实限制了这份安静能够持续的时间。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他在为难中重新感受到亲近，暂时不逼自己作出决定，享受片刻欢喜，但现实中的难题仍使安静无法持续。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S08-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"还没想出怎样争取才不伤温柔几乎重复了 S07-4 已经说清的未决难题，虽然承担了解释安静为何短暂的作用，但再次完整说出略显啰嗦。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e0ce72d8-4d9d-40da-a6c7-de7e229f9a5b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232612221577Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.406, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:27:23.643862+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ee14fbd6bc9306b3999d12828c2380266e27fbe280c107b4e5a695ca241adfc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563